                    38.0,
                    880.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Coordinating Committee members may be expected to gather appropriate data prior to convening meetings. Coordinating Committee meetings will be convened to review appeals, to collect information from all parties and to respond with suggestions for process improvement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                37,
                904,
